Oops, yes, kalci for the first one but vikmi for the second one.

And no I don't think ko is needed for the second one.  I see it as an
observative like "eat, sleep, fuck.  This is life" sort of thing (though
obviously with a somewhat darker bent).

I suppose stress could be used to figure out which is meant, but it's
certainly not super-clear

